et_Necklace_E_Pearl_A_1_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Amulet_Necklace_E_Pearl_A_1_Faded.png/300px-Amulet_Necklace_E_Pearl_A_1_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/b/b4/Amulet_Necklace_E_Pearl_A_1_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Pearl Necklace image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Amulet_Necklace_E_Pearl_A_1_Faded.png/300px-Amulet_Necklace_E_Pearl_A_1_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b4/Amulet_Necklace_E_Pearl_A_1_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>A <b>Pearl Necklace</b> is a common <a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\">Amulet</a>. Primarily of use for barter or sale to <a href=\"/wiki/Traders\" title=\"Traders\">Traders</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Tiny rainbows reflect in the pearls' iridescent shine.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties_4\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-ic